      {
        "Id": "7338a3c43ba94e4bbd66faff649f7cd3",
        "Title": "HOW TO USE:  open the floor plan of the level to copy from (or select elements).  0 = levels above to copy to.  1-13 = True for each category that should travel; doors + windows come with their host wall.  14 = only wall types whose name contains the text.  Set 17 = False first to see what would be copied, then True.  Run again = nothing is doubled (16 SKIP) or the old copies are replaced (REPLACE).",
